Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:36.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}Stay as you are, I’ll stay as I know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:38.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}Together we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.59,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur10}So, can you feel the burning flash?
